title: President Hindenburg ejects <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**SPD**</span> ministers!
new-page: true
subtitle: Let the presidential cabinets begin...
tags: event
view-if: young_plan_ratified and spd_in_government and hindenburg_angry > 120 and President == "Hindenburg"
on-arrival: {! 
Q.hindenburg_angry -= 70;

Q.spd_left += 3;
Q.spd_in_government = 0;
Q.spd_toleration = 1;
Q.spd_patience = 50 + Q.spd_relation/5;

if (Q.chancellor_party != Q.dvp_name) {
    Q.chancellor = "Brüning";
    Q.chancellor_party = Q.z_name;
}
if (Q.foreign_minister_party != Q.dvp_name) {
    Q.foreign_minister = "Brüning";
    Q.foreign_minister_party = Q.z_name;
}
if (Q.interior_minister_party != Q.dvp_name) {
    Q.interior_minister = "Wirth";
    Q.interior_minister_party = Q.z_name;
    if (Q.csrp_formed) Q.interior_minister_party = "CSRP";
    if (Q.social_catholics_dvp) Q.interior_minister = "Bolz";
}
if (Q.justice_minister_party != Q.dvp_name) {
    Q.justice_minister = "Guérard";
    Q.justice_minister_party = Q.z_name;
    if (Q.ddp_exist) {
        Q.justice_minister = "Koch-Weser";
        Q.justice_minister_party = Q.ddp_name;
    }
}
if (Q.labor_minister_party != Q.dvp_name) {
    Q.labor_minister = "Stegerwald";
    Q.labor_minister_party = Q.z_name;
}
if (Q.reichswehr_minister_party != Q.dvp_name) {
    Q.reichswehr_minister = "Groener";
    Q.reichswehr_minister_party = "I";
}
if (Q.economic_minister_party != Q.dvp_name) {
    Q.economic_minister = "Hermes";
    Q.economic_minister_party = Q.z_name;
}
if (Q.finance_minister_party != Q.dvp_name) {
    Q.finance_minister = "Köhler";
    Q.finance_minister_party = Q.z_name;
}
if (Q.agriculture_minister_party != Q.dvp_name) {
    Q.agriculture_minister = "Hermes";
    Q.agriculture_minister_party = Q.z_name;
    if (Q.dbp_exist) {
        Q.agriculture_minister = "Fehr";
        Q.agriculture_minister_party = "DBP"
    }
}
!}


= President Hindenburg ejects <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**SPD**</span> ministers!

The cabinet has been reshuffled, we shall remain in government as a minority coalition, tolerated by the <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**SPD**</span>. We now have the unenviable task of managing the crisis, keeping our coalition together, avoiding a vote of no confidence by the <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**SPD**</span> and trying to stay in President Hindenburg's good graces.

- @continue: Continue...

@continue
